iogenesis.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033044 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033044 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9185-3994>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4033044 \"2023-06-20T10:27:17Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:31558434\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:331922198\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:36883528\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4033044 \"In humans, deuterosomal cells have been noted to have enriched expression of the following: PLK4, FOXJ1, DEUP1, FOXN4, YPEL1, HES6 and CDC20B. Deuterosomal cells were termed after deuterosomes, the platforms of active centriole amplification.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4033044 \"deuterosomal cell\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033044 obo:CL_0000066)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033044 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0004802))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033044 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002215 obo:GO_0098535))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4033045 (lung migratory dendritic cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34516781\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033045 \"A dendritic cell that captures antigens in a lung and migrates to a lymph node or to the spleen to activate T cells.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033045 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033045 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9185-3994>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4033045 \"2023-06-21T10:04:46Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34516781\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4033045 \"lung mDC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34516781\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003000) Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType obo:OMO_0003004) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4033045 \"lung mDCs\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4033045 \"lung migratory dendritic cell\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033045 obo:CL_0000451)\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4033046 (ON midget ganglion cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32032773\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033046 \"A midget ganglion cell that depolarizes in response to increased light intensity in the center of its receptive field. The majority of input that this cell receives comes from invaginating midget bipolar cells.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033046 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4033046 \"2023-08-08T09:40:08Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34093409\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033046 \"ON-midget RGC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34093409\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033046 \"ON-midget cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32032773\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033046 \"inner stratifying midget cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4033046 \"ON midget ganglion cell\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4033046 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_4023032 obo:CL_4023188))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4033047 (OFF midget ganglion cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32032773\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033047 \"A midget ganglion cell that depolarizes in response to decreased light intensity in the center of its receptive field. The majority of input that this cell receives comes from flat midget bipolar cells.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033047 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4033047 \"2023-08-08T11:05:37Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34093409\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033047 \"OFF-midget RGC\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34093409\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033047 \"OFF-midget cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32032773\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033047 \"outer stratifying midget cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4033047 \"OFF midget ganglion cell\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4033047 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_4023033 obo:CL_4023188))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4033048 (respiratory tract suprabasal cell)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25564622\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:34044844\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:35387001\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:37834236\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033048 \"A respiratory epithelial cell derived from a basal cell, with a topographic nuclear position between the basal and luminal cells of the airway epithelium. This non-basal, intermediate progenitor cell has limited proliferative capacity and can differentiate into multiciliated, secretory, or rare airway cells (ionocytes, tuft cells, neuroendocrine cells). It shares some ultrastructural features with basal cells but lacks the defined characteristics of fully differentiated cellular phenotypes.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033048 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033048 <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-9185-3994>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4033048 \"2023-06-20T10:44:30Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25564622\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033048 \"respiratory parabasal cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033048 \"respiratory suprabasal cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25658372\") oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym obo:CL_4033048 \"respiratory suprabasal progenitor cell\")\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:25658372\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:32726565\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"doi:10.1101/2023.04.20.537495\") rdfs:comment obo:CL_4033048 \"In humans, respiratory tract suprabasal cells have been noted to have enriched expression of the following: CK8, KRT13, IVL, and SERPINB3. Single-cell sequencing indicates that suprabasal cells derived from the nasal epithelium are distinct from those in the tracheobronchial epithelium.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4033048 \"respiratory tract suprabasal cell\")\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033048 obo:CL_0011026)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033048 obo:CL_7770004)\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033048 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0004802))\nSubClassOf(obo:CL_4033048 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:RO_0002202 obo:CL_0002633))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4033049 (taste receptor cell of tongue)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"DOI:10.1111/j.1096-3642.1981.tb01137.x\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:10052456\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:28655883\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"http://www.nejohnston.org/Birds/documents/AvianTongues_Johnston.pdf\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033049 \"A taste receptor cell that is part of a taste bud of a tongue.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_4033049 <https://orcid.org/0000-0001-6677-8489>)\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:date obo:CL_4033049 \"2023-05-03T07:59:58Z\"^^xsd:dateTime)\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"DOI:10.1016/s0022-5320(69)80043-2\") oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym obo:CL_4033049 \"gustatory cell of tongue\")\nAnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label obo:CL_4033049 \"taste receptor cell of tongue\")\nEquivalentClasses(obo:CL_4033049 ObjectIntersectionOf(obo:CL_0000209 ObjectSomeValuesFrom(obo:BFO_0000050 obo:UBERON_0014451)))\n\n# Class: obo:CL_4033050 (catecholaminergic neuron)\n\nAnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"ISBN:0521442516\") Annotation(oboInOwl:hasDbXref \"PMID:12094209\") obo:IAO_0000115 obo:CL_4033050 \"A neuron that releases catecholamine as a neurotransmitter.\")\nAnnotationAssertion(terms:contributor obo:CL_